    old "《你们这些还魂尸》\n\n一部基于罗伯特·海因莱因同名小说的原创同人改编视觉小说。\n\n在一家深夜的酒吧里，你将扮演酒保，倾听一位陌生人讲述他不可思议的一生——并通过你的选择，决定如何理解这个关于时间、身份与孤独的故事。\n\n· 对话探索型叙事\n· 三轴情感系统，导向多种结局\n· 中英双语\n\n非商业作品，谨向原作致敬。"
    new "All You Zombies\n\nAn original fan-adaptation visual novel based on Robert A. Heinlein's story of the same name.\n\nIn a late-night bar, you take the role of the bartender, listening to a stranger tell the story of his impossible life — and through your choices, deciding how to understand this tale of time, identity, and loneliness.\n\n· Dialogue-driven exploration\n· A three-axis emotion system leading to multiple endings\n· Bilingual (Chinese / English)\n\nA non-commercial work, made in tribute to the original."
